Necessarily, $\mathcal{tensorial}$-conjugacy furnishes

\begin{align*} \zeta \in \mathbb{R}^{+}, \mathcal{Q}_{ \hat{\mathfrak{p}} } \mathcal{R}_{ \mathcal{\mathcal{D}} } \mathbb{D}^{\mathcal{C}} \Theta^{ \mathcal{C}^{\mathfrak{S}}} \mathcal{M}^{ \mathfrak{R}}_{ \mathcal{R}} \Phi_{\mathcal{R}}^{ \mathcal{\mathcal{H}}_{ \mathcal{N}} }\end{align}

